  {
   "t0": 3.4,
   "t1": 9.07,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The clock strikes four, and Clara is still holding her note. She has pressed only once."
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.07,
   "t1": 10.26,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "That"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.26,
   "t1": 12.07,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "says the Butler"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.07,
   "t1": 15.16,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "is a note that takes up the whole bar."
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.16,
   "t1": 17.94,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    15.16
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.94,
   "t1": 18.74,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.74,
   "t1": 21.74,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "A true story from music history."
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.74,
   "t1": 27.6,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Semibreve means \u201chalf a breve\u201d, and breve means short. The breve used to be a short note."
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.6,
   "t1": 34.32,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Like the minim, it grew longer over the years. Today the breve is so long that you hardly ever see it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.32,
   "t1": 34.92,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.92,
   "t1": 36.81,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "The Butler\u2019s note."
  },
  {
   "t0": 36.81,
   "t1": 41.37,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "A dot adds half again. A semibreve fills the whole bar."
  },
